# Architecture Documentation Sync

Update `.claude/references/architecture-documentation.md` only when the current
public or structural architecture changes: feature/package boundaries, domain
models, services, use cases, shared components, state ownership, navigation, or
new/renamed AppStyle tokens.

Do not update it for private refactors, layout-only changes, token value swaps,
or test expectation changes.

Route to one relevant section using
`.claude/skills/reviewing-code-changes/references/architecture-routing.md`;
never load or rewrite the complete document for a local change.
